== Trivia ==
* The item resembles {{E|Ultra Greed}}'s head.
* The coins fired are the same as Ultra Greed's coin projectiles.
** {{Dlc|r}} The coins fired now use their own unique sprite, which is significantly smaller than before.
* When picked up as {{C|Keeper}} or {{C|Tainted Keeper}}, they will begin smiling.

